From 79f81dc9b4562ef00efd8bcbf888a24d6eef4f94 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Timo <1788603+darknagel@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 18:07:25 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] oneplus-instantnoodlep: enable microphones

- linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250: the three digital microphones are
  powered from other WCD9385 micbias outputs than on the 8T; take the
  micbias routing from the vendor device tree (updated patch 0005).
- alsa-ucm-conf-oneplus-instantnoodlep: add the "Mic" device: DMIC2
  (main microphone) and DMIC1 on the VA macro, decimator gain +24 dB.

Tested with PulseAudio: speech at 30 cm peaks around -22 dBFS.

Signed-off-by: Timo <1788603+darknagel@users.noreply.github.com>
