-not deliver a signal yet.
+The three digital microphones (DMIC1, DMIC2 and DMIC3) are powered from
+other WCD9385 micbias outputs than on the 8T. Take the micbias routing
+from the vendor device tree: DMIC0/1 on MIC BIAS1, DMIC2 on MIC BIAS3
+and DMIC3 on MIC BIAS4.
+
+Tested: both speakers play audio, and all three microphones record
+through the VA macro with PulseAudio.
 
